  "goodToKnow": "Der Lebensretter or die Lebensretterin is a lifesaver: someone who saves a life in an emergency, and colloquially anyone who helps out: Du bist mein Lebensretter! Things can be lifesavers too: Defibrillatoren sind Lebensretter. Retten means to save. A lifeguard is der Rettungsschwimmer, often from the DLRG. The plural is the same."
